    <!-- Terms &amp; policy on signup -->
    <string name="terms_agree">I have read and agree to the Terms &amp; Community Policy</string>
    <string name="terms_view">Read Terms &amp; Policy</string>
    <string name="terms_title">Terms &amp; Community Policy</string>
    <string name="terms_body">BaryoBenta is a community marketplace for meet-up, face-to-face buying and selling. To keep everyone safe from scams, every member must follow these rules:\n\n• Sell only what you own. Post real items with honest photos, descriptions and prices. Fake or bait listings are banned.\n\n• Pay for items in person. Buyers pay sellers face-to-face at the meetup. Never send deposits, advance payments, shipping fees, or reservation fees to a buyer or seller.\n\n• Wallet credits are for seller fees only. Sellers may request wallet top-ups through the app. Credits are added only after an administrator verifies the payment. Every item posted costs a flat fee of 10 digital credits, deducted from the seller’s credits when the listing is published. Buyers do not pay through the app.\n\n• No scams or fraud. Scamming, impersonation, harassment, or listing prohibited items may result in listing removal and a permanent ban.\n\n• Verification matters. Verified badges help buyers trust you. Lying during verification may remove your badge or suspend your account.\n\nReport suspicious listings or users and meet in a safe public place.</string>
    <string name="error_terms_agree">Please agree to the Terms &amp; Community Policy first</string>
